ull},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-10-20T07:41:30Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T07:17:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111656*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen there is a theme with gdscript. We need load theme before main scene.\r\n\r\n1. Load theme.tres\r\n2. Load sub-resource (gdscript) of theme\r\n3. Set script to theme (Texture2D). And in `set_script()` we will create instance for the script, which will invoke `implicit_new` function of this script.\r\n4. When debugger enabled, `implict_new()` function will call `EngineDebugger::get_singleton()->line_poll()`, I guess it try to refresh the current debug information.\r\n5. The calling of `line_poll()` is too early, we didnot load main scene, yet. So the error messages reported.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L3906\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nI add a `started` flag to `EngineDebugger`, to decide whether main scene had been loaded.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111838/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111838/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}